@api = https://localhost:7201

### Create a tenant
POST {{api}}/api/v1/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Contoso",
  "contactEmail": "it@contoso.example",
  "maxDevices": 25
}

### List tenants
GET {{api}}/api/v1/tenants?page=1&pageSize=25

### Update a tenant's fields (JSON merge patch: send only what changes; null clears)
PATCH {{api}}/api/v1/tenants/<tenant id>
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json

{
  "plan": "Professional",
  "maxDevices": 50
}

### Suspend a tenant (then :activate or :cancel)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/tenants/<tenant id>:suspend

### Enroll an agent
POST {{api}}/api/v1/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "<id of the tenant created above>",
  "machineName": "CONTOSO-PC01",
  "operatingSystem": "Windows 11 Pro",
  "processorCores": 8,
  "totalMemoryMb": 16384
}

### List online devices
GET {{api}}/api/v1/devices?status=Online
